<title>HONG KONG: BNP HK branch sets HK$150 mln FRCD issues.</title>
<headline>BNP HK branch sets HK$150 mln FRCD issues.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issues was announced by arranger Oakreed Financial Services Ltd.</p>
<p>BORROWER  BANQUE NATIONALE DE PARIS, HK BRANCH</p>
<p>****TRANCHE A****</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$100 MLN   COUPON	7.81 PCT  MATURITY   8 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	   ISS PRICE    PAR	LISTING    NONE</p>
<p>REPAYMENT BULLET	 DENOMS	HK$1 MLN  SALE LMTS   NONE</p>
<p> RATING    MOODY'S AA3  HOME CTRY   HK</p>
<p> GOV LAW   HK	     PAY DATE    17.MAR.97</p>
<p>****TRANCHE B****</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$50 MLN    COUPON	8.10 PCT  MATURITY   10 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	   ISS PRICE   PAR	 LISTING    NONE</p>
<p>CALLS     YR 6	   CALL PRICE  PAR	 DENOMS   HK$1 MLN</p>
<p> RATING    MOODY'S AA3  SALE LMTS   NONE	HOME CTRY  HK</p>
<p> GOV LAW   HK	     PAY DATE    25.MAR.97</p>
<p> NOTES    OAKREED FINANCIAL SERVICES LTD IS THE SOLE ARRANGER</p>
<p>AND MANAGER OF THE ISSUES</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
